This directory contains the subset needed for curve arithmetic and hashing:
  src/secp256k1lab/__init__.py -> __init__.py
  src/secp256k1lab/secp256k1.py -> secp256k1.py
  src/secp256k1lab/util.py -> util.py
  COPYING -> COPYING

The files were copied unchanged from bip-0374/secp256k1lab in this repository,
which vendors the revision above. The package is placed here so the reference
implementation runs without installing packages or accessing another BIP's
directory. No upstream source files have been modified.
